2. Product names and trademarks. These remain the property of their respective
   owners. Nothing here grants any trademark rights, and nothing here implies
   endorsement by any vendor named in the text.

3. Cited works. Quotations from and links to third-party publications remain
   subject to their own terms.

4. Figures reproduced from published works. Where a figure from a third-party
   publication is reproduced - including the country-and-capital PCA figure in
   the embeddings chapter, taken from Mikolov, Sutskever, Chen, Corrado and
   Dean, "Distributed representations of words and phrases and their
   compositionality" (NIPS 2013) - it is not the author's to license. It is
   reproduced here for the purposes of comment and criticism, with attribution
   in the figure caption. Anyone reusing this work must assess their own basis
